==========================================================================
D2. Poisson model: season fixed effects + day-of-season shape + the line
==========================================================================
The rate ratio is promotions per day past the line against promotions per
day before it, after the stated controls. 1.00 means the line does nothing.

  no controls (raw jump at the line)                   rate ratio 1.560  95% CI 1.309-1.859  z=4.96  p=0.0000
  + season fixed effects only                          rate ratio 1.560  95% CI 1.309-1.859  z=4.96  p=0.0000
  + season FE + day-of-season shape  <-- THE TEST      rate ratio 1.266  95% CI 0.856-1.872  z=1.18  p=0.2377

